Local patch for STEAMtool at zeyuxie29/AudioTime@9ac2023 (not from upstream).
Applied by scripts/download_data.sh. It loads best.pth on PyTorch >= 2.6,
handles empty or very short generated clips, and clips predicted event
boundaries to the clip duration.

